(text "Reference-designator continuation: R11-R17 were already used on power_3v3/power_sources,\nso this sheet continues at R18-R24 (ILIM/EN-pulldown/FAULT-pullup roles per DESIGN_SPEC.md).\nJ5 on power_3v3 was extended from Conn_01x08 to Conn_01x12 to carry RADIO_EN/GNSS_EN/RADIO_FAULT_N/GNSS_FAULT_N to the pending MCU sheet." (at 15 270 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid a8f3e8c5-f82a-538f-bd12-ae210566a2d3))
